#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Zadana vrijednost za prazan ifHighSpeed"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Prilikom izračuna pragova izraza, ako ifHighSpeed i ifSpeed vrate nulu, umjesto toga upotrijebi sljedeću postavku ifHighSpeed. Zadana vrijednost za ifHighSpeed bit će 10000 za 10GE sučelja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Postavke obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući naslijeđene obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira onemogućit će se naslijeđeno upozoravanje za sve pragove. Naslijeđeno upozoravanje definira se kao sva specifična upozorenja e-poštom koja nisu povezana s popisom obavijesti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Obavijesti praga putem predloška"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom stvaranja predloška praga njegove će postavke obavijesti prema zadanom biti u vlasništvu predloška praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Omogući izvršavanje naredbi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira omogućit će se pokretanje naredbi prilikom događaja prekoračenja i vraćanja praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Omogući obavijest za pojedini Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira omogućit će se održavanje prilagođenih tijela poruka e-pošte za pragove."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Omogući red čekanja obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira prebacit ćete Thold s izravnog slanja obavijesti na korištenje pozadinskog servisa za obavijesti ili na obavijesti koje izvan opsega izvršava prozivač obavijesti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Omogući slanje poruka e-pošte uzbune na popise obavijesti o upozorenjima"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Označite ovaj okvir ako želite da primatelji s popisa obavijesti o upozorenjima primaju i poruke e-pošte uzbune uz primatelje s popisa obavijesti o uzbunama. Ovaj je slučaj primjenjiv kada obavijesti o upozorenjima idu administratorima, a obavijesti o uzbunama upravi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Pozadinski servis za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Omogući pozadinski servis za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira omogućit će se korištenje namjenskog pozadinskog servisa za pragove. To se može koristiti za povećanje performansi sustava i/ili za raspodjelu nadzora pragova na zaseban poslužitelj."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Prisilno uključi otklanjanje pogrešaka pozadinskog servisa za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog okvira omogućit će se otklanjanje pogrešaka pozadinskog servisa za pragove pri radu putem sustava SystemD ili naredbenog retka. Ova je promjena dinamična i stupit će na snagu čim započne sljedeća petlja pragova."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost obavijesti o nedostupnosti pozadinskog servisa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Ako se utvrdi da pozadinski servis Thold ne radi, šalji obavijest e-poštom ovom učestalošću."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Svaki %d sat"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Dretve pozadinskog servisa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Broj dretvi pozadinskog servisa kojima će upravljati pozadinski servis za pragove."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proces"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d procesa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Zapisivanje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Zapisuj prekoračenja pragova u zapisnik"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Omogući zapisivanje svih neuspjeha pragova u zapisnik sustava Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Prikaži izvor podataka u zapisniku"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Prikaži naziv izvora podataka u zapisniku ako nije prisutan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Zapisuj promjene pragova u zapisnik"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Omogući zapisivanje svih promjena pragova u zapisnik sustava Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Zapisnik za otklanjanje pogrešaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Omogući zapisivanje poruka za otklanjanje pogrešaka za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Čuvanje zapisnika upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Čuvaj zapisnike pragova ovoliko dana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Zapisuj radnju Smatraj nepoznate podatke nulom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno 'Smatraj nepoznate podatke nulom', zapiši u zapisnik kada se to dogodi"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Postavke Sysloga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog omogućen"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom stvaranja novog praga novi će se događaji praga prema zadanom slati u vaš lokalni syslog. Ova je postavka unaprijed zadana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarno upravljanje zapisnikom syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Zadani prioritet/razina"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ovo je zadani prioritet/razina koju će Thold koristiti za slanje poruka sustavu syslog. Ova je postavka unaprijed zadana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarno upravljanje zapisnikom syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Zadana kategorija"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ovo je zadana kategorija koju će Thold koristiti za slanje poruka sustavu syslog. Ova je postavka unaprijed zadana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarno upravljanje zapisnikom syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Unaprijed zadane postavke upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Izuzeća za vikend"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Thold se neće izvoditi vikendom."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Zadani broj okidanja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Zadani broj uzastopnih puta kada izvor podataka mora prekoračiti prag da bi se aktivirala uzbuna."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Ponovno uzbunjivanje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Ponovi uzbunu nakon navedenog broja ciklusa ispitivača."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Unaprijed zadane osnovne vrijednosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Zadani vremenski raspon osnovne vrijednosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Ovo je zadana vrijednost koja se koristi pri stvaranju pragova ili predložaka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Broj okidanja osnovne vrijednosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Zadani broj uzastopnih puta kada izvor podataka mora prekoračiti izračunati prag osnovne vrijednosti da bi se aktivirala uzbuna."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Postotak odstupanja osnovne vrijednosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti SNMP obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "SNMP obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Poruke o statusu praga (informacije/zamke) bit će poslane primateljima SNMP obavijesti. To prema zadanim postavkama uključuje uzbune, upozorenja i zamke za oporavak. Napomena: ova značajka zahtijeva dodatak Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući obavijesti upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Prag neće slati obavijest kada je prekoračen prag upozorenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući obavijesti o oporavku"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Prag neće slati obavijest kada se prag vrati u normalno stanje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti slanja e-pošte"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Šalji poruke e-pošte s hitnim prioritetom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Omogućuje vam postavljanje poruka e-pošte s hitnim prioritetom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Šalji uzbune kao tekst"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, sve će se uzbune slati kao poruke e-pošte u običnom tekstu bez grafikona. Zadano su to HTML poruke e-pošte s grafikonom ugrađenim u poruku e-pošte."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Pošalji e-poštu zasebno za svaku adresu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, sva e-pošta bit će poslana zasebno za svaku adresu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte pošiljatelja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je adresa e-pošte koja će biti prikazana kao pošiljatelj Praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Ime pošiljatelja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je stvarno ime koje će biti prikazano kao pošiljatelj Praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti obavijesti za uređaje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Omogući obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Omogući obavijest o nedostupnom/oporavljajućem glavnom računalu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Jedinstvena obavijest e-poštom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Podržano samo za popise obavijesti i red čekanja obavijesti. Ako postoje obavijesti o nedostupnim uređajima u jednom ciklusu obrade, pošalji samo jednu poruku e-pošte primateljima s popisa obavijesti za sve uređaje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Predmet jedinstvene obavijesti e-poštom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr "Ovo je predmet poruke e-pošte koji će se koristiti za sve jedinstvene obavijesti e-poštom za dostupne i nedostupne uređaje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Delay Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti odgode obavijesti za uređaje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Delay"
msgstr "Odgoda obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If a large influx of Down Device Notifications come in, Cacti can pause sending out those Notifications for a certain period of time to see if the issue is transient before sending them out.  Select the threshold Down Device Notifications before the Pause is Triggered."
msgstr "Ako stigne velik broj obavijesti o nedostupnim uređajima, Cacti može pauzirati slanje tih obavijesti na određeno vrijeme kako bi provjerio je li problem privremen prije slanja. Odaberite prag obavijesti o nedostupnim uređajima prije pokretanja pauze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If you choose to delay Notifications for a large Down Devices Notification inrush, how long are you willing to wait before allowing the notifications to be processed?"
msgstr "Ako odlučite odgoditi obavijesti zbog velikog naleta obavijesti o nedostupnim uređajima, koliko ste dugo spremni čekati prije nego što dopustite obradu obavijesti?"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Email Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti e-pošte za obavijesti o uređajima"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Global Notification Email"
msgstr "Globalna e-pošta za obavijesti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Address that the Dead Device Notifications will be sent to if the Global Notification List is selected."
msgstr "Ovo je adresa e-pošte na koju će se slati obavijesti o nedostupnim uređajima ako je odabran globalni popis obavijesti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Down Subject"
