#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Naredba visokog okidača"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljena i ako se prekorači visoki prag, pokrenut će se ova naredba. Unesite valjanu naredbu. Osim toga, dostupno je nekoliko zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu upotrijebiti za prosljeđivanje podataka s praga u skriptu. To možete učiniti kao argumente u naredbenom retku ili, po mogućnosti, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti pojavit će se u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Naposljetku, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za računalo (Host), upit podataka (Data Query) i unos podataka (Data Input). Na primjer, ako imate prilagođeni podatak unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za zamjenu upotrijebite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita podataka i računala upotrijebite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx|, odnosno |host_xxxx|."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Naredba niskog okidača"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno, i ako se prekorači donji prag, izvršit će se ova naredba. Unesite valjanu naredbu. Osim toga, dostupno je nekoliko zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu upotrijebiti za prosljeđivanje informacija s praga skripti. To možete učiniti kao argumente u naredbenom retku ili, poželjnije, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti pojavit će se u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Konačno, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za glavno računalo, upit podataka i unos podataka. Na primjer, ako imate prilagođene podatke unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za zamjenu upotrijebite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita podataka i glavnog računala upotrijebite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx| odnosno |host_xxxx|."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Naredba okidača normalnog stanja"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno, kada se prag vrati na normalnu vrijednost, izvršit će se ova naredba. Unesite valjanu naredbu. Osim toga, dostupno je nekoliko zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu upotrijebiti za prosljeđivanje informacija s praga skripti. To možete učiniti kao argumente u naredbenom retku ili, poželjnije, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti pojavit će se u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Konačno, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za glavno računalo, upit podataka i unos podataka. Na primjer, ako imate prilagođene podatke unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za zamjenu upotrijebite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita podataka i glavnog računala upotrijebite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx| odnosno |host_xxxx|."

